    "testimonials_6xHFGj": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "column_UfFjkt": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Best blanket ever!",
            "text": "<p>I am thrilled to find such excellent quality in the blankets<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Jess<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_NKGdwP": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Unmatched comfort!",
            "text": "<p>It takes forever to get the blankets but I absolutely love mine that I received. Bought 2 XL kings for my bed and 1 full just for me.<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Ekin<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_9FHQtH": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Perfect!",
            "text": "<p>The pajamas from The Fleece Company are SO soft I can hardly believe it! I bought a pair the next day for my sister,too!<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Sarah<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_nffryz": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Beautiful!",
            "text": "<p>The pyjamas I ordered are beautiful and soft. I have ordered a second set because now I’ve tried these I don’t want to wear anything else.<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Mia<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_NBnkKz": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "No More Night Sweats",
            "text": "<p>I have hot flashes when I wake up during the night. The fleece blanket is really soft and not too hot or cold. I’m very much enjoying it and my husband has his own. I just purchased 2 warmer ones for winter!<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Tessa<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_ydrW9L": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "So Comfortable",
            "text": "<p>Truly can’t get enough, so comfortable , washes beautifully and will definitely buy more. Thanks for the cuddly comfort<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Olivia<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_QDHcDi": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Great For All Seasons",
            "text": "<p>Just the perfect blanket for Spring, Summer & Fall. light weight yet warms you up plus just Cole and l leave mine hanging on back of chair in same room when not using for an accent in the room .<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Clara<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_zp6mpN": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Top-Notch Products",
            "text": "<p>Products are top notch and I found it easy to negotiate their web site. After ordering my first pair, I received a discount code for next order. Pretty common but the pajamas I received were so soft I ordered a second pair.<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Anna<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_KzKjH6": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Muslin & Fleece Love",
            "text": "<p>The products are excellent. I have one of the muslin blankets which is so soft and am currently waiting for one of the fleece blankets<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Laura<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_rDmjC7": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Fast Shipping, Great Blanket",
            "text": "<p>The ordering process was easy shipping was very quick and the blanket is amazing<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Marie<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_cp8f63": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Lightweight and Cozy",
            "text": "<p>Great blankets. Very soft and cozy though being really lightweight. Made from natural fabric. Lovely colours. Looking forward to trying them over the winter.<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Nora<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_CxXqNp": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warm Yet Not Heavy",
            "text": "<p>Love this king size blanket! It’s very light, not heavy like most. Yet it keeps you warm and comfy!<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Lea<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_cbryTQ": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Quick & Easy Order",
            "text": "<p>Excellent products and service. Well packaged and items are well made! Support service is outstanding and willing to resolve issues in a timely manner. Highly recommend this company and their clothing. Communication regarding delivery is excellent! Will buy from again and again.<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Isabella<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_cB4nXP": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Exceeded Expectations",
            "text": "<p>The fleece blanket actually exceeded my expections, not just in the look of the product, but also the feel. Soft, inviting, calming colour (I had the green). I have now ordered a blue one for my daughter, to stop her stealing mine!<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Amelie<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        },
        "column_W96GcV": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Quality #1",
            "text": "<p>Ordering is easy. Notification of shipment is quick. The product is great - the first is great so ordered another!<\/p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Lizzy<\/strong><\/em>"
          }
        }
      },
